;; fixture — beancount-reconcile eval12/13 (first-month rehearsal: imported August, fee not yet recorded)
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-08-01 open Assets:Checking USD
2026-08-01 open Income:Salary USD
2026-08-01 open Expenses:Groceries USD
2026-08-01 open Expenses:Dining USD
2026-08-01 open Expenses:Fees USD
2026-08-01 open Equity:OpeningBalances USD

2026-08-01 * "Opening balance"
  Assets:Checking          1000.00 USD
  Equity:OpeningBalances

2026-08-05 * "Synthetic Employer" "August salary"
  import-id: "bank:august-salary"
  Assets:Checking          2000.00 USD
  Income:Salary

2026-08-10 * "Synthetic Market" "Groceries"
  import-id: "bank:august-groceries"
  Assets:Checking           -50.00 USD
  Expenses:Groceries

2026-08-15 * "Synthetic Cafe" "Coffee"
  import-id: "bank:august-coffee"
  Assets:Checking            -5.00 USD
  Expenses:Dining
